    "synopsis": "A world with five tribes… Angels, Demons, Beastfolk, Vampires, and Humans. Elle is an angel and a member of the police force who boasts powerful abilities. With her strong sense of justice, she is strict on herself and others while dedicating herself to her duties. Elle, who is well on her way to a promotion, is assigned to capture a timid demon named Eve. Although Eve has been arrested many times before, she has somehow managed to escape every time. Now tasked with catching the troublemaker, Elle finds that due to her summoning power and elusive nature, apprehending Eve is far from easy! On top of that, while pursuing Eve, Elle finds herself getting into all sorts of other troubles…!? (Source: Kadokawa, translated)",
